      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clemson_University"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Prominent athletics facilities at Clemson University include Memorial Stadium, Littlejohn Coliseum, Doug Kingsmore Stadium, and Historic Riggs Field.",
